{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@preconcurrency"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"compactMap"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"ElementOfResult"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"transform"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"attribute","text":"@Sendable"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"attribute","text":"@escaping"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sci7ElementQa","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Element","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/AsyncSequence\/Element"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ElementOfResult","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sci12_ConcurrencyE10compactMapyAA020AsyncThrowingCompactC8SequenceVyxqd__Gqd__Sg7ElementQzYaKclF0H8OfResultL_qd__mfp"},{"kind":"text","text":"?) -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12_Concurrency31AsyncThrowingCompactMapSequenceV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AsyncThrowingCompactMapSequence","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/AsyncThrowingCompactMapSequence"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ElementOfResult","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sci12_ConcurrencyE10compactMapyAA020AsyncThrowingCompactC8SequenceVyxqd__Gqd__Sg7ElementQzYaKclF0H8OfResultL_qd__mfp"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An error-throwing mapping closure. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"transform"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"accepts an element of this sequence as its parameter and returns a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"transformed value of the same or of a different type. If "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"transform"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"throws an error, the sequence ends."}]}],"name":"transform"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Return Value","level":2,"anchor":"return-value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An asynchronous sequence that contains, in order, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"non-"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" elements produced by the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"transform"},{"type":"text","text":" closure. The sequence"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ends either when the base sequence ends or when "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"transform"},{"type":"text","text":" throws an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"error."}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"compactMap(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" method to transform every element received from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a base asynchronous sequence, while also discarding any "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" results"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from the closure. Typically, you use this to transform from one type of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"element to another."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In this example, an asynchronous sequence called "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Counter"},{"type":"text","text":" produces "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"values from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"1"},{"type":"text","text":" to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"5"},{"type":"text","text":". The closure provided to the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"compactMap(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"method takes each "},{"code":"Int","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and looks up a corresponding "},{"code":"String","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" from a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"romanNumeralDict","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" dictionary. Since there is no key for "},{"code":"4","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", the closure"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"returns "},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in this case, which ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"compactMap(_:)"},{"text":" omits from the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"transformed asynchronous sequence. When the value is "},{"code":"5","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", the closure"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"throws "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MyError"},{"type":"text","text":", terminating the sequence."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let romanNumeralDict: [Int: String] =","    [1: \"I\", 2: \"II\", 3: \"III\", 5: \"V\"]","","do {","    let stream = Counter(howHigh: 5)","        .compactMap { (value) throws -> String? in","            if value == 5 {","                throw MyError()","            }","            return romanNumeralDict[value]","        }","    for try await numeral in stream {","        print(numeral, terminator: \" \")","    }","} catch {","    print(\"Error: \\(error)\")","}","\/\/ Prints \"I II III Error: MyError() \""]}]}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swift\/asyncthrowingcompactmapsequence\/compactmap(_:)-1ecis"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/doc